{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19905","headline":"西斋养病夜怀多感因呈上从叔子云 · 孟郊","name":"西斋养病夜怀多感因呈上从叔子云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远客夜衣薄，厌眠待鸡鸣。\n一床空月色，四壁秋蛩声。\n守淡遗衆俗，养疴念余生。\n方全君子拙，耻学小人明。\n蚊蚋亦有时，羽毛各有成。\n如何骐骥迹，蜷局未能行。\n西北有平路，运来无相轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}